  "description": "A high-performance CSV reading and writing library for .NET 9. Features include strongly-typed record mapping, custom type conversions, header management, configurable delimiters, dynamic property support, and async operations. Supports RFC 4180 compliance, escape modes, and extensive configuration options for field validation and transformation.",
